sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Doctor as Doctor
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Doctor->>System: callNextToken(doctorId)
    activate System
    System-->>Doctor: displayPatientClinicalFile(patientId, medicalRecord)
    deactivate System

    Doctor->>System: submitConsultationData(complaints, diagnosisCode, prescriptionItems)
    activate System
    System->>System: saveConsultationRecord()
    System->>System: saveDiagnosis()
    System->>System: generatePrescription()
    System-->>Doctor: consultationCompleted(consultationId, status="Completed")
    deactivate System
